      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Pero el libro cuenta algo más: a veces, de noche, la tierra lloraba.",
          "en": "But the old book tells one more thing: sometimes, at night, the earth would cry."
        },
        {
          "es": "La gente decía que no daba frutos si no recibía ofrendas.",
          "en": "People said she would not give fruit unless she received offerings."
        },
        {
          "es": "Para los mexicas era una deuda: la tierra nos alimenta, así que algo se le devuelve.",
          "en": "To the Mexica, it was a debt. The earth feeds us, so something is given back."
        }
